to show how the fast API is

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:16.335
being queried from within
this shiny application.

00:18:16.335 --> 00:18:19.215
So here in the top left
corner, this is the shiny application.

00:18:19.215 --> 00:18:20.575
It's nothing but R code,

00:18:20.575 --> 00:18:24.330
which is used to create
interactive web applications.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.570
So we're gonna use a
shiny package for this,

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:30.295
but also note that we're
using this jsonLite and httr

00:18:30.295 --> 00:18:33.255
package to interact
with our API.

00:18:33.255 --> 00:18:37.335
So I'm gonna scroll down here
to the server function and just

00:18:37.335 --> 00:18:40.260
