00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:46.075
So this first bit
of code right here,

00:18:46.075 --> 00:18:49.595
this is where we actually ping
that API, so we feed it that

00:18:49.595 --> 00:18:51.995
API URL, which I
saved as a variable,

00:18:51.995 --> 00:18:57.610
and we can provide some
query parameters to that API.

00:18:57.610 --> 00:19:00.890
We then take that response,
alright, we gather it here,

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:04.285
and then we convert that
JSON responds into a data frame,

00:19:04.285 --> 00:19:07.245
which will eventually be
converted over to a Tibble.

00:19:07.245 --> 00:19:11.840
We save that as a response
data which gets fed into a ggplot.

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:14.560
Let's go ahead and run
this shiny application so you can

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:16.560
see how it works.

00:19:20.275 --> 00:19:23.555
So the first thing you'll
see here is this input box,

00:19:23.555 --> 00:19:26.755
