as many letters as we want.

00:19:26.755 --> 00:19:31.310
So I'll select a few
letters. We'll do C, J, M,

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.910
let's do P as well. And once
we have the letters selected,

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:39.875
we can then query the API
by clicking on this box.

00:19:39.875 --> 00:19:41.075
And then once we do that,

00:19:41.075 --> 00:19:44.755
